Os pré-socráticos: fragmentos, doxografia e comentários (@greek-source-nova-cultural: 0, is #book, #part-of @greek-portuguese-editions) { r_6ZA1ENV6PB59E6EGC7MCBS1782
Seleção de textos e supervisão: José Cavalcante de Souza; dados biográficos: Remberto Francisco Kuhnen; traduções de José Cavalcante de Souza e outros. São Paulo: Nova Cultural, 1996. Coleção Os Pensadores. ISBN 8535106944. Portuguese.

[Edition in the Biblioteca Nacional catalogue](https://acervo.bn.gov.br/Sophia_web/acervo/detalhe/580332).

**Read with:** [Pre-Socratic fragments, nature, and being](../presocratics/Nature-and-being.lingua#r_61M87EN28QQ9AHXT80SPCB0CVH). Use the corresponding thinker's section for the guide's question. Read the fragments, doxography, and commentary as distinct kinds of material: a reported quotation, an ancient account, and a later interpretation can support different claims.

Compare a selected passage with [Fairbanks' English collection](Presocratics-Fairbanks.lingua#r_0CETPRSWH0WZT8335D8692RNJY) or [Burnet's historical account](Early-Greek-Philosophy-Burnet.lingua#r_1DSKX3DB6E343PZHZABGATVK13). Record the edition and page, the ancient source, and any fragment number the edition supplies. Preserve those identifiers when the number or arrangement differs in another collection.

**Access:** library or an owned copy of the edition. **Reuse:** publisher's terms. The catalogue identifies the reference edition.

